- action(n1, "start review process"): Hallucinates an undocumented preliminary step; the description states the clerk should "start by reviewing the received application", making this extra task unsupported.
- action(n12, "end"): Hallucinates a final activity; the description states the process simply "will come to an end" after writing back the data, which is already correctly captured by end(e1).
- actor(a_default, "Default", [...]): Fails to faithfully reflect responsibilities; the description explicitly assigns all steps to "the review clerk", but the model assigns them to a generic "Default" actor.